menu "Cogitador M-01 photo store"

    config COGITADOR_PHOTOS_SLOTS
        int "Stills kept in the photos partition (oldest replaced)"
        range 1 10
        default 10
        help
            Each slot is 48 KiB in the 512 KiB "photos" partition, so at most 10.
            The gallery on the eye screen shows them, newest first.

endmenu
